Provider marks in assets/

  anthropic.svg, antigravity.svg, copilot.svg, cursor.svg, deepseek.svg,
  kimi.svg, opencode.svg, openrouter.svg, supergrok.svg, xiaomi.svg
    Simple Icons (https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons), CC0 1.0
    Universal. Recoloured to a single white silhouette; geometry unchanged.
    antigravity.svg is the Google Gemini mark; supergrok.svg is the xAI mark.

  openai.svg, fireworks.svg
    Omarchy's own agents plugin
    (/usr/share/omarchy/shell/plugins/agents/assets), MIT, Basecamp.
    Recoloured to a single white silhouette; geometry unchanged.

Every mark remains the trademark of its owner and is used here only to
identify that provider's own account in the owner's status bar.
